[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Finding: the C library has NO explicit error surface
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Both C functions are **totally branch-free**. There is:
