[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * no range check, no null check, no size/length parameter at all;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * no `if`, no `switch`, no `#if`/`#ifdef` — the object code has zero conditional
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   jumps derived from input;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * no min/max constant, no magic sentinel;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * no enum type anywhere in the public header, so there is no
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   out-of-range-enum-value class of input;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * the only pointer parameter, `cn_rnd_t *rnd`, is dereferenced unconditionally
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   (`c_src/src/lib.c:4`) with no guard.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `double next_double(cn_rnd_t *)` is a total function over its 128-bit input
